{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026SH5dWfWJ4Y1795846582.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>下周一是世界愛滋病日，衞生署一連兩日舉辦活動響應。</p><p></p><p>全球同抗愛滋病運動在觀塘海濱舉行，衞生署署長林文健等出席啟動禮。活動設戶外藝術展覽，署方期望透過藝術裝置、互動教育展板、手作工作坊等，讓公眾認識治療愛滋病發展及預防資訊等。</p><p></p><p>展覽一連兩日，由中午12時至晚上8時免費入場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T06:55:06.920104+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":136,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T05:18:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:18.626123+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T06:48:18.626123+00:00","content_hash":"16dbaa81675a6c114b2f6a27739d223d0c8ac24fcdbaf6e58e53f44ff2813902","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}